a shell line that reaches the limit is refused: true
a system line under the process limit but past cmd.exe's is refused at cmd.exe's own limit: true
a pform with no bound is refused: true
a read of a file no judgment bounds is refused: true
an action head on neither list is refused: true
a chdir to a directory the scan cannot resolve is refused: true
an include stanza is refused: true
a dune file sexplib would read with a hole in it is refused: true

